OL,3,GNEWSABus company defends widespread
OL,4,Atimetable changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers are being warned about
OL,7,Fupcoming timetable changes to some bus
OL,8,Froutes across Norwich and Norfolk.
OL,10,FFirst Bus said routes including those
OL,11,Fin Norwich, Great Yarmouth,
OL,12,FAttleborough and Wymondham would be
OL,13,Fchanging "to improve reliability and
OL,14,Fpunctuality".
OL,16,FAll services to the Harts Farm estate
OL,17,Fin Wymondham will be cut and services
OL,18,Ftaking people from Great Yarmouth to
OL,19,Fthe James Paget Hospital will be
OL,20,Freduced to one an hour.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
