OL,3,GNEWSABus company defends widespread
OL,4,Atimetable changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Bus East of England regional
OL,7,Fdirector, Simon Mathieson, said that
OL,8,Fwhile some decisions had been "hard",
OL,9,Fthe company was constantly reviewing
OL,10,Fits services based on demand and
OL,11,Fsustainability.
